{"1062960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "UNDER the SAND - a road trip simulator", "steam_appid": 1062960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1980's. Alternative reality. Global warming has turned the whole world into a endless desert. Due to the aggressive climate, the blessings of civilization gradually go under the sand. Set out on a long journey on your old pickup truck to fulfill the last request of your late father. But is there a place left on this planet where it’s possible to do this? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INFINITELY GENERATED PATH</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 200 kilometers of unique road sections - asphalt and off-road.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 unique points of interest that you can encounter along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forks and crossroads - you can choose your own path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to stop by roadside stores to sell all your junk!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far can you drive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ASSEMBLY, MAINTENANCE AND TUNING OF CARS</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expandable fleet of cars of different classes that can be found while traveling the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almost all car parts can be removed and changed - wheels, doors, hood, steering wheel, engine, battery, headlights on the roof, dashboard figures and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liquid transfer - the car will not move without gasoline, and without water in the radiator the engine will overheat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced vehicle physics. Tires behave differently on different surfaces and accidents lead to damage to car parts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your driving style - install an economical engine and enjoy a calm ride, or install a racing engine and start drifting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your vehicle unique by painting various parts - from the body to the wheel rims</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Working suspension!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CREATE YOUR CHARACTER</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to customize the character's appearance - from hair to eyebrows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several classes to choose from - from a wanderer to a punk - each has its own characteristics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FULLY CUSTOMIZABLE GAME EXPERIENCE</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to customize the degree of damage, thirst, hunger and fatigue of the character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to customize the degree of damage to cars, as well as fluid consumption</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to meet more objects and locations in the world? Such a setting is also available!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVEN MORE FEATURES?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No zombies, maniacs or crazy animals. This game is about cars, driving and exploring the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bright, juicy stylized low-poly graphics. On the verge of cartoonish and semi-realistic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music cassettes! Insert them into your car radio and listen to music of different genres. From calm lo-fi to hard rock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's a cat at home that needs feeding!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And this is a game about traveling, after all!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1980's. Alternative reality. Global warming has turned the whole world into a endless desert. Due to the aggressive climate, the blessings of civilization gradually go under the sand. Set out on a long journey on your old pickup truck to fulfill the last request of your late father. But is there a place left on this planet where it’s possible to do this? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INFINITELY GENERATED PATH</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 200 kilometers of unique road sections - asphalt and off-road.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 unique points of interest that you can encounter along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forks and crossroads - you can choose your own path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to stop by roadside stores to sell all your junk!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far can you drive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ASSEMBLY, MAINTENANCE AND TUNING OF CARS</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expandable fleet of cars of different classes that can be found while traveling the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almost all car parts can be removed and changed - wheels, doors, hood, steering wheel, engine, battery, headlights on the roof, dashboard figures and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liquid transfer - the car will not move without gasoline, and without water in the radiator the engine will overheat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced vehicle physics. Tires behave differently on different surfaces and accidents lead to damage to car parts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your driving style - install an economical engine and enjoy a calm ride, or install a racing engine and start drifting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your vehicle unique by painting various parts - from the body to the wheel rims</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Working suspension!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CREATE YOUR CHARACTER</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to customize the character's appearance - from hair to eyebrows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several classes to choose from - from a wanderer to a punk - each has its own characteristics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FULLY CUSTOMIZABLE GAME EXPERIENCE</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to customize the degree of damage, thirst, hunger and fatigue of the character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to customize the degree of damage to cars, as well as fluid consumption</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to meet more objects and locations in the world? Such a setting is also available!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVEN MORE FEATURES?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No zombies, maniacs or crazy animals. This game is about cars, driving and exploring the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bright, juicy stylized low-poly graphics. On the verge of cartoonish and semi-realistic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music cassettes! Insert them into your car radio and listen to music of different genres. From calm lo-fi to hard rock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's a cat at home that needs feeding!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And this is a game about traveling, after all!</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "You. Your car. And world under the sand.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian, Bulgarian, Ukrainian, Spanish - Spain, French, German, Danish, Czech, Italian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1062960/46f64ed51a89d91495f63c486c4bb390d02617b1/header.jpg